OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome light scattered showers,
OL,6,Fmainly during the morning and in
OL,7,FArgyll and around the west coast, but
OL,8,Fmany staying dry, particularly in east
OL,9,Fwhere the best of the afternoon highs
OL,10,Fare expected. West to southwest
OL,11,Fbreezes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTurning unsettled with
OL,14,Fthickening cloud heralding periods of
OL,15,Frain that reach the far west late
OL,16,Fevening, before following to all
OL,17,Fovernight with heavier outbreaks in
OL,18,Fthe west and strengthening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
